# Changesets

This monorepo uses [Changesets](https://github.com/changesets/changesets) for version management and release notes.

We use a **fixed** version group: `itineraryedge`, `@itineraryedge/web`, `@itineraryedge/shared`, and `@itineraryedge/core-worker` always share the same version. Packages are **not** published to npm.

## Adding a changeset

When your PR includes a user-visible or release-worthy change, add a changeset from the repo root:

```bash
pnpm changeset
```

Follow the prompts (patch / minor / major and a short summary). Commit the generated file under `.changeset/`.

See [docs/versioning.md](../docs/versioning.md) for the full workflow.
